{{Passive skill box|Chainbreaker}}
'''Chainbreaker''' is a {{il|Timeless Jewel}}-only [[keystone passive skill]]. It grants [[rage]] regeneration based on [[mana regeneration]], prevents mana recovery from regeneration, and adds a base [[cost]] of 3 rage to skills. Rage gained from this keystone does not delay inherent rage loss. 

==Mechanics==
The rage cost is affected by cost modifiers, such as multipliers on support gems, but also global modifiers such as {{psl|Tireless}}, {{stl|Fanaticism}}, or {{il|Indigon}}. Note that the vast majority of skill cost modifiers are specific for [[mana]], which do not apply to rage costs. 

Note that this passive's rage regeneration {{c|mod|Does not delay Inherent Loss of Rage}}, meaning that for rage to be gained, rage regeneration must either exceed the inherent loss per second (10 by default), or rage loss must first be delayed in another way (e.g. with {{psl|Vengeance}}). 

==Location==
This keystone will [[conquered|conquer]] any keystones within the jewel radius of a {{il|Lethal Pride}} that has modifier {{c|mod|Commanded leadership over (10000–18000) warriors under '''Akoya'''}}.

